---
Preview or create a stopped-profile backup

Usage: mxr backup create [OPTIONS] --source-data <SOURCE_DATA> --output <OUTPUT>

Options:
      --source-data <SOURCE_DATA>
      --source-config <SOURCE_CONFIG>  Explicit non-secret account settings file. Omit to use DB settings only
      --output <OUTPUT>
      --confirm
  -h, --help                           Print help
